1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
In a small town, lived a woman named Alina.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,000
She wasn't famous, rich, or highly educated,

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,000
but she was deeply respected.

4
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Why?

5
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Because Alina worked five jobs.

6
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,000
She cleaned houses early in the morning,

7
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:16,000
worked as a cook in a local school during the day,

8
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,000
delivered packages in the afternoon,

9
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,000
helped her elderly neighbors in the evening,

10
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:23,000
and made handmade crafts at night to sell online.

11
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:25,000
People often asked, aren't you tired?

12
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Isn't this too much?

13
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Alina would smile and say,

14
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:31,000
yes, I get tired,

15
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:33,000
but each job feeds a part of my life.

16
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:35,000
One puts food on the table,

17
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:37,000
one keeps my son in school,

18
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:39,000
one supports my sick mother,

19
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:40,000
one helps others,

20
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:42,000
and one feeds my creativity.

21
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:44,000
I'm not just working,

22
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:45,000
I'm building.

23
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:46,000
Years passed,

24
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:50,000
and Alina slowly expanded her online business.

25
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:52,000
Eventually, she hired others

26
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:54,000
and quit her exhausting side jobs.

27
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:58,000
What stayed constant, however, was her mindset.

28
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:00,000
When you don't wait for perfect conditions,

29
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:02,000
and do your best with what you have,

30
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:03,000
doors open.

